<title>USA: Smith Corona Q4 net loss lessens.</title>
<headline>Smith Corona Q4 net loss lessens.</headline>
<dateline>NEW CANAAN, Conn 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary     $0.20		    $1.67</p>
<p> Net loss	  6,100		    50,700</p>
<p> Sales	     22,700		   41,500</p>
<p>		  Year</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $0.37	     loss $1.73</p>
<p> Net loss	  11,100	    loss 52,400</p>
<p> Sales	     112,500		  196,300</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Smith Corona Corp.</p>
<p>Fiscal year ended June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>Q4 figures include $10 million writedown charges.</p>
<p>Fiscal year figures include $17.9 million writedown charges.</p>
<p>Fiscal year figures include $17.8 milllion gain from Signapore facility sale and $1.5 million pension curtailment gain.</p>
<p>Company said improvement in performance results was due to asset sales, reduced spending and lower tax charge.</p>
</text>
